*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
