==Strategy==
This stage is similar to [[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]] stage of [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 1. The Cat God lacks a way to hit units outside of his range, but he is still a threat as a backliner for the strong [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemies. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] can help eliminate the weaker units while [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] damages the Cat God when he is exposed. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] can also be useful to tank the Angels, but this is only necessary after the boss is defeated.

==Trivia==
*Crimes Against the Cosmos' name may refer to how [[The Cat God]] is not supposed to be in [[Legend Stages]] due to it taking place before his birth, thus making his appearance in this stage a "crime against the cosmos".
*Crimes Against the Cosmos' Japanese name, Uchū no Hōsoku ga Midareta (宇宙の法則が乱れた, "Universe's Laws Disrupted"), is almost identical to the Japanese name of [[wikia:finalfantasy:Power of the Void|Power of the Void]] from the ''[[wikipedia:Final Fantasy|Final Fantasy]]'' series: Uchū no Hōsoku ga Midareru (宇宙の法則が乱れる, "Disrupting the Universe's Laws").

